# Deploy scaffolding delivered to the working folder, never part of the repo.
# Untracked patches were the reason `git am` refused to apply three separate times
# ("untracked working tree files would be overwritten"), which is why every deploy
# script carries a pre-flight block to delete them.
*.patch
deploy-*.ps1
finish-*.ps1
_deploy-archive/
